## Get Started in 30 Seconds

```bash
# 1. Install
pip install adryserage-aetheris

# 2. Configure (free Gemini API key: https://ai.google.dev)
echo "GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key" > .env
echo ".env" >> .gitignore  # IMPORTANT: Never commit API keys

# 3. Analyze
aetheris analysis
```

